report-renderer/*.pdf
report-renderer/*.png

# Autoprompt transient run-state / governance (never versioned)
.ief-runs/
.ief-runs
.epo_ops_cache/
PROMPTS.txt
ROADMAP.md
GATELOG.md
*.autoprompt.tmp
.autoprompt/

# Autoprompt local execution state outside repo (preferred)
# transient state lives in ~/.ief-runs/<evaluation-id>/ and evaluations/<id>/ — governance artifacts PROMPTS.txt etc. must never appear in diff

